  "baseCommit": "412d1d28a8bb5409aa71136c0e49f6b7e7d9046a",
  "review": "Bounded Custom2 single-OP self-feedback with canonical X32/Y0 one/two-native-frame history and owned-cell initialization on new logical attacks. Complete reviewed sources and dependencies are pinned; 66 legacy PCM, fixed FM and non-self Custom2 cases retain exact native PCM, RAM, active/final state, registers, writes and serialized v4/v5 exports at 44.1/48 kHz. Existing runtime, core/SSF WASM, gains and historical evidence remain unchanged; new feedback behavior is covered by independent raw native tests.",
