        {
          "afterOffset": 515,
          "afterBytes": 62,
          "beforeText": "\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"synth.css?v=scsp-ssf-dsp-1\" />\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 17420,
          "afterBytes": 900,
          "beforeText": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Choose an operator above, then its inputs and direct output. An operator can both modulate another and produce sound. One source feeds both hardware inputs; with two sources, SCSP averages X and Y. Clear an existing input before reversing a connection.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This graph editor and its voice allocation are Synth software over SCSP slot modulation. Custom accepts acyclic 2 / 4 / 6OP connections. Self modulation and feedback loops are future work; raw physical CH controls keep their existing behavior.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 18608,
          "afterBytes": 267,
          "beforeText": ""
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 43017,
          "afterBytes": 159,
          "beforeText": "\t\t\t\t\t\ttwo inputs per operator; FM feedback is future work. The editor core uses zero slot-write delay. SSF\n"
